Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Disables all default Windows sounds (Default Beep / volume slider, warnings,
; notifications, device connect, UAC, logon, Explorer navigation, startup, etc.)
; Equivalent to choosing the "No Sounds" scheme in Control Panel > Sound and
; unchecking "Play Windows Startup sound".
; HKCU keys need no admin rights; HKLM startup sound key requires Admin.
; Sign out and back in to fully apply.

; Disable Windows Startup sound (machine-wide, requires Admin).
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Authentication\LogonUI\BootAnimation]
"DisableStartupSound"=dword:00000001

; Mark the active scheme as "No Sounds" so the Sound control panel agrees.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\AppEvents\Schemes]
@=".None"

